const FASHION_WALL = {"note":"英国街上大家身上穿的东西，英国人怎么叫、美国人怎么叫。点一张看一句能用的话；图来自 Fila UK 官方商品清单。","note_en":"What people wear on British streets, and what Brits and Americans call it. Tap one for a line you can use. Photos from Fila UK's official product feed.","disclose":"图片和价格来自 Fila UK 官方商品清单（Awin）。「看看」是联盟链接：通过它买，HeyVoyo 会得到一点佣金，你付的价钱不变。","disclose_en":"Photos and prices from Fila UK's official product feed (Awin). \"Have a look\" is an affiliate link: if you buy through it, HeyVoyo earns a small commission at no extra cost to you.","fact":"Fila 是意大利牌子（1911 年，比耶拉），现在归韩国 Fila Holdings，这里是它的英国网店。一个牌子，三个国家。","fact_en":"Fila is Italian (Biella, 1911), now owned by Korea's Fila Holdings; this is its UK shop. One brand, three countries.","shop":{"name":"Fila UK","mid":19475,"site":"https://fila.co.uk","img":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0271/3973/5629/"},"groups":[{"e":"👟","t":"鞋","en":"Shoes","items":[{"w":"trainers","e":"👟","zh":"运动鞋","us":"sneakers","line":"Are those new trainers?","line_zh":"那是新买的运动鞋吗？","note":"这双 Disruptor 是 90 年代的“老爹鞋”（chunky trainers），2018 年前后又火了一遍。","note_en":"The Disruptor is a '90s chunky trainer that came back around 2018.","img":"files/black-disruptor-2-5fm00002-014-side_3_69e4f68c-854a-48e9-8b7d-7a96430fb80a.jpg?v=1740579894","name":"Disruptor 2","price":"£60","path":"/products/disruptor-2-black-edition-trainers"},{"w":"sliders","e":"🩴","zh":"运动拖鞋","us":"slides","line":"Can I wear sliders to the gym?","line_zh":"能穿拖鞋去健身房吗？","note":"夹脚的叫 flip-flops，室内棉拖叫 slippers。","note_en":"Toe-post ones are flip-flops; indoor ones are slippers.","img":"files/BBSLIDE-4SS10007-001_01.jpg?v=1710936849","name":"BB Slider","price":"£28","path":"/products/bb-slider-4ss10007-001"}]},{"e":"👕","t":"衣服裤子","en":"Clothes","items":[{"w":"hoodie","e":"🧥","zh":"连帽卫衣","us":"hoodie","line":"Grab a hoodie, it's freezing out.","line_zh":"拿件卫衣吧，外面冷死了。","note":"没有帽子的叫 sweatshirt 或 jumper。","note_en":"Without a hood it's a sweatshirt or a jumper.","img":"products/Finn-F22MH009-410_28.jpg?v=1662367643","name":"Finn Hoodie","price":"£70","path":"/products/finn-hoodie-f22mh009-410"},{"w":"trackies","e":"👖","zh":"运动裤（口语）","us":"sweatpants","line":"I'm just in my trackies.","line_zh":"我就穿着运动裤（没打扮）。","note":"正式一点说 tracksuit bottoms 或 track pants。","note_en":"More formally: tracksuit bottoms or track pants.","img":"products/HERITAGETRACKPANT-TW23C152-412_01.jpg?v=1658397232","name":"Heritage Track Pant","price":"£35","path":"/products/heritage-track-pant-tw23c152-412"},{"w":"puffer jacket","e":"🧥","zh":"羽绒服 / 棉服","us":"puffer jacket","line":"You'll need a puffer jacket up north.","line_zh":"去英国北边得带件羽绒服。","note":"英国人常简称 puffer，也有人写成 puffa。","note_en":"Often just a puffer, sometimes spelt puffa.","img":"products/Evan-FW22ASU006-356_27.jpg?v=1664959327","name":"Evan Puffer Jacket","price":"£45","path":"/products/evan-unisex-panelled-puffer-jacket-fw22asu006-356"},{"w":"gilet","e":"🦺","zh":"马甲（坎肩）","us":"vest","line":"A gilet is perfect for spring.","line_zh":"春天穿马甲正合适。","note":"小心：在英国 vest 是贴身的背心！gilet 读作 /ˈʒɪleɪ/。","note_en":"Careful: in the UK a vest is an undershirt! Say /ˈʒɪleɪ/.","img":"files/MILTON-FW24MH026-661_24.jpg?v=1727878692","name":"Archive Puffa Gilet","price":"£42.50","path":"/products/archive-puffa-gilet-fw24mh026-661"}]},{"e":"🧢","t":"帽子","en":"Hats","items":[{"w":"bucket hat","e":"👒","zh":"渔夫帽","us":"bucket hat","line":"Bucket hats are back again.","line_zh":"渔夫帽又流行回来了。","note":"90 年代英国 Britpop 乐队常戴，现在街上又到处都是。","note_en":"Big with '90s Britpop bands, and everywhere again now.","img":"products/TABBS_FHXS2310_410_01.jpg?v=1675848021","name":"Tabbs Bucket Hat","price":"£26","path":"/products/tabbs-bucket-hat-fhxs2310-410"},{"w":"baseball cap","e":"🧢","zh":"棒球帽","us":"ball cap","line":"Where did you get that cap?","line_zh":"你这帽子哪儿买的？","note":"后面能调松紧的叫 snapback。","note_en":"One with an adjustable back strap is a snapback.","img":"products/img01_130765ff-8808-42dd-bf40-ab50960d1ebb.jpg?v=1674751597","name":"Illa Baseball Cap","price":"£30","path":"/products/illa-baseball-cap-xf19blk030-410"}]}]};

